=== prompt
For each of the integers -3, 0 and 7 (in that order), log `negative`, `zero` or `positive`.
=== expected
negative
zero
positive
=== reference
[-3 0 7] = xs
0 | Var(i)
Repeat({
  xs | Take(i) = x
  If({x | IsLess(0)} {"negative"} {If({x | Is(0)} {"zero"} {"positive"})}) | Log
  Inc(i)
} times: 3)
